[
    {
        "content": "<p>I think I may have found, if not a bug, an instance of some surprising behaviour while playing around with notations and typeclasses. I tried to minimize my example as much as possible, and this is what I have arrived to:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://live.lean-lang.org/#codez=IYIxCcFMDcAIBECCA5A4gUQEqwFwF5YAFcAewAcAoCgYwBtgBnB2ZEgF2DYEsSA7AYXpNYACi4BbMrVywSAVzaFg4YONgAeAD4IUGTAEoKoCDBbtOPAUIYA6CVNgBve9Jw60WAL6wA2qw7cfIKMzC4AujJIHtj4sC4UvKqQDGTA1JCwAMrU5JAUDDlkkAAmsLzmgbywAESwgHwbgM17NbCweAB8ZgGWwUx2krQUkLyl2bkUuVWjRVSJ4smp6bAA8mwAFpDgVNDKXKC0Gc79kbpevv4WQdZx%2FWEU2%2BC7IPtOGZAA5G7InJ6OgMPAsL8Pixvo44NA3jIvmxPFQuMM5NRuNAMlE9DJiORYAB3dZQCgtbScEjiLjUGSNWCAJMJ3HoqMVIAAzGlYGwMkgkclNamorC4PD40QrXE2HmYGxEklkgDthiAA\">Notation introduces <code>sorry</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://live.lean-lang.org/#codez=IYIxCcFMDcAIGUCCAxAorAXAXlgBXAPYAOAUCQMYA2wAzjbAHIEAuwzAlgQHYDC1dsABTsAtkUqZYBAK7NcwcMBGwAPAB8EKVAEoSoCDEYs2nXvxoA6UeNgBvaxIya0AX1gBtJqw7c%2Bteg4AupJIaJg4DiRcSpA0RMDkkAjkxJAkNClEkAAmsFzGPlywAESwgHwbgM17JbCwWAB8Rt6mfnRWYpQkkFy58JlpqUW9qWTRIrHxibAA8swAFpDgZNAK7KCUSfbtIVpungXN5rBBJMvgqyDrdkmQAORODGwutoDDwLDPd4yPtnDQN5IPzBcZHY3Wk5A40CSABFEAwAOKoABKknwxFgAHd5lASDUNGwCCJ2ORJJVYIAkwlgMPhSLI2UgADNKbCEYiLPSCAQSVUKVSWeEcUIZliLLykRZ8YTiQB23RAA\">Notation does not introduce <code>sorry</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://gist.github.com/ayhon/e447049eb8357600f23f2a5fcb11ea9b/revisions\">Diff between both versions (see latest revision)</a></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler-block\"><div class=\"spoiler-header\">\n<p>Code and explanations</p>\n</div><div class=\"spoiler-content\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<p>The MWE I arrived to in the end was this. It seems like, because of the notation, Lean is getting confused between the two definitions for <code>DANGER</code>: <code>_root_.DANGER</code> and <code>Other.DANGER</code></p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">abbrev</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">DANGER</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Prop</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">NotationClass</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">impl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">outParam</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">DANGER</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">abbrev</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">NotationClass</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">impl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">impl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">DANGER</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">NotationClass</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">impl</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">DANGER</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">impl</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">namespace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Scope</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">scoped</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">notation</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\" 🪳 \"</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">NotationClass</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">impl</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">end</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Scope</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Scope</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">namespace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Other</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">variable</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">impl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">DANGER</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">NotationClass</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">impl</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">variable</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">e'</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"o\">}{</span><span class=\"n\">σ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">σ'</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"o\">}{</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">inductive</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">DANGER</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Prop</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">intro</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">🪳</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">DANGER</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">DANGER</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">foo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">🪳</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">DANGER</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Other</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">DANGER</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">intro</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>From what I understand, when both names are the same Lean will interpret the domain of <code>Other.DANGER.intro</code> to be <code>_root_.DANGER</code>, and not <code>Other.DANGER</code>, which is what I would expect it to choose since its the domain of a constructor of <code>Other.DANGER</code>! If I change the name of <code>_root_.DANGER</code> to something else (i.e. <code>SAFE</code>), then Lean correctly interprets the domain.</p>\n</div></div>",
        "id": 590213022,
        "sender_full_name": "Fernando LEAL",
        "timestamp": 1776865253
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I have further simplified it since</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">abbrev</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">DANGER</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Prop</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">NotationClass</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">impl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">outParam</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">DANGER</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">abbrev</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">NotationClass</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">impl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">impl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">DANGER</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">NotationClass</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">impl</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">DANGER</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">impl</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">namespace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Other</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">variable</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">impl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">DANGER</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">NotationClass</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">impl</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">variable</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">e'</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"o\">}{</span><span class=\"n\">σ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">σ'</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"o\">}{</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">inductive</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">DANGER</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Prop</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">intro</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">NotationClass</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">impl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">DANGER</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">DANGER</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">foo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">NotationClass</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">impl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">DANGER</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Other</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">DANGER</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">intro</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 590220002,
        "sender_full_name": "Fernando LEAL",
        "timestamp": 1776866745
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Minimized:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">abbrev</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Danger</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Prop</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">NotationClass</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">impl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">outParam</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Danger</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">abbrev</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">NotationClass</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">impl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">impl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Danger</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">NotationClass</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">impl</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Danger</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">impl</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">namespace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Other</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">variable</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Danger</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">NotationClass</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Danger</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">foo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">NotationClass</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">impl</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">Unit</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">end</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Other</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 590221184,
        "sender_full_name": "Floris van Doorn",
        "timestamp": 1776867006
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Even simpler version (which may not be the exact same issue)</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">abbrev</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Danger</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Prop</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">namespace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Variant</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">variable</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Danger</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c\">/-</span><span class=\"cm\"> Error: type expected, got (Danger : Nat) -/</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Danger</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">3</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">foo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">rfl</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 590221371,
        "sender_full_name": "Floris van Doorn",
        "timestamp": 1776867051
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>(Note the unexpected place the error is reported in the last example.)</p>\n<p>This has to do with the fact that variables are re-elaborated every time they are inserted to a declaration. That is problematic in this case, which the last example shows well.</p>",
        "id": 590221928,
        "sender_full_name": "Floris van Doorn",
        "timestamp": 1776867176
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>More context given e.g. here: <a class=\"message-link\" href=\"/#narrow/channel/270676-lean4/topic/Bug.20in.20elaboration.3F/near/512170154\">#lean4 &gt; Bug in elaboration? @ 💬</a>, where <span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"306601\">@Kyle Miller</span> already mentions that it's possible to break a well-formed <code>variable</code> declaration</p>",
        "id": 590223888,
        "sender_full_name": "Floris van Doorn",
        "timestamp": 1776867580
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I see. Looks like a complicated fix. Thankfully, for my usecase it seems like I can work around it with a couple of renamings, which is not ideal but better than the alternative</p>",
        "id": 590225584,
        "sender_full_name": "Fernando LEAL",
        "timestamp": 1776867945
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>You can also use fully qualified names like</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">variable</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">impl</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"n\">root_</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">DANGER</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">NotationClass</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">impl</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>to avoid the issue, but renaming would be more robust.</p>",
        "id": 590227161,
        "sender_full_name": "Kyle Miller",
        "timestamp": 1776868296
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I'm surprised there's no visible error in this example.</p>",
        "id": 590227291,
        "sender_full_name": "Kyle Miller",
        "timestamp": 1776868328
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>At least in both Fernando's and Floris's examples, you can see that the variables had an elaboration error since the local context contains a <code>sorry</code>:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">inst</span><span class=\"bp\">✝</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">NotationClass</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>and hovering over that <code>sorry</code> contains</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">sorryAx</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Unit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"n\">root_</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">DANGER</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">true</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>The <code>true</code> indicates it was generated as part of an elaboration error.</p>",
        "id": 590228423,
        "sender_full_name": "Kyle Miller",
        "timestamp": 1776868566
    }
]